      "time_updated": 1789860189908
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To extract fields from an invoice, I will use Amazon Textract, a service that automatically extracts text and data from scanned documents. I will write a Python script that uses the Boto3 library to interact with Amazon Textract. The script will identify the provider by importing the Boto3 library and using the Textract client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860194512,
          "start": 1789860189909
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbfb16d5001aBHPnUUcP3iH0w",
      "message_id": "msg_0bbfb1225001UBlXHNzQSNt6Ob",
      "session_id": "ses_f4404ee66ffe3FQbV5S2E5YU6V",
      "time_created": 1789860189909,
      "time_updated": 1789860194513
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "tooluse_YORE1LVkIdEA01ZFv7c07k",
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "import boto3\n\ndef extract_invoice_fields(document_path):\n    textract_client = boto3.client('textract')\n    \n    with open(document_path, 'rb') as document:\n        image_bytes = document.read()\n    \n    response = textract_client.analyze_document(\n        Document={'Bytes': image_bytes},\n        FeatureTypes=['TABLES', 'FORMS']\n    )\n    \n    invoice_data = {\n        'vendor': None,\n        'date': None,\n        'total': None,\n        'line_items': []\n    }\n    \n    for block in response['Blocks']:\n        if block['BlockType'] == 'KEY_VALUE_SET':\n            if block['Text'] == 'Vendor':\n                invoice_data['vendor'] = block['Relationships'][0]['Ids'][0]\n            elif block['Text'] == 'Date':\n                invoice_data['date'] = block['Relationships'][0]['Ids'][0]\n            elif block['Text'] == 'Total':\n                invoice_data['total'] = block['Relationships'][0]['Ids'][0]\n        elif block['BlockType'] == 'TABLE':\n            for relationship in block['Relationships']:\n                if relationship['Type'] == 'CHILD':\n                    for child_id in relationship['Ids']:\n                        for child_block in response['Blocks']:\n                            if child_block['Id'] == child_id:\n                                if child_block['BlockType'] == 'CELL':\n                                    invoice_data['line_items'].append(child_block['Text'])\n    return invoice_data\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    document_path = 'sample_invoice.pdf'\n    invoice_fields = extract_invoice_fields(document_path)\n    print(invoice_fields)",
            "filePath": "/private/var/folders/bf/pt_kfhl16yb4r9vfb588n1fm0000gn/T/vb-staged-3dwbnouy/extract_invoice_fields.py"
